        <h3>Capt. David Pruner</h3><p>Learned to fish on Indiana lakes with his dad, who taught him that patience and persistence are what catch fish. He has been at it for 25 years.</p></div>
      <div class="captain"><img src="/images/capt-gonzales.webp" alt="Capt. Frankie Gonzales holding a snook" loading="lazy" width="619" height="826" style="object-position:top">
        <h3>Capt. Frankie Gonzales</h3><p>Has spent 30 years on the inshore water from Tampa Bay up into the southern Nature Coast.</p></div>
      <div class="captain"><img src="/images/capt-hahn.webp" alt="Capt. Rob Hahn holding a gag grouper" loading="lazy" width="1102" height="1400">
